            "line": 450,
            "text": "theorem MeanClass.bilinear_wave {s : StripData D} {P : ℕ → D → ℝ}\n    {α β : ℝ} {f : ℕ → D → E} {g : ℕ → D → F}\n    (hf : MeanClass s α f) (hg : WaveClass s P β g)\n    (hζ : ∀ x ∈ s.domain, s.zeta x ≤ 1) (L : E →L[ℝ] F →L[ℝ] G) :\n    WaveClass s P (α + β) (fun n x => L (f n x) (g n x))"
